{"title":"Career Roadmap — Plant Manager (Food)","role":"Plant Manager (Food)","summary":"A Plant Manager in the food industry is responsible for the overall operation, productivity, safety, quality, cost, workforce, maintenance, and regulatory compliance of a food-processing manufacturing facility.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Food Processing Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Plant Manager in the food industry is responsible for the overall operation, productivity, safety, quality, cost, workforce, maintenance, and regulatory compliance of a food-processing manufacturing facility."},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines food technology","industrial engineering","operations management","quality","supply chain","people leadership."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Manufacturing operations"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Equipment and maintenance coordination"},{"text":"Workforce management"},{"text":"Raw-material planning"},{"text":"Inventory management"},{"text":"Cost control"},{"text":"Waste reduction"},{"text":"Energy and water efficiency"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Continuous improvement"},{"text":"Production KPI management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Major employers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dairy companies"},{"text":"Beverage manufacturers"},{"text":"Bakery and confectionery companies"},{"text":"Packaged-food companies"},{"text":"Meat and seafood processors"},{"text":"Frozen-food companies"},{"text":"Grain and cereal processors"},{"text":"FMCG companies"},{"text":"Food ingredient manufacturers"},{"text":"Nutraceutical manufacturers"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Pr